== a trapped signal ends a blocking wait in the default mood:
action-default
status=derived
rc=0
== a trapped signal ends a blocking wait in the sh mood:
action-sh
status=derived
rc=0
== the interrupted wait leaves its job running:
action-alive
child-alive=0
rc=0
== a child arrival leaves the wait blocked:
chld-fired
chld-fired
chld-wait-status=6
rc=0
== a signal with no action leaves the wait blocked:
ignored-wait-status=5
rc=0
